labels/
apps/api/labels/

# Email system: SendGrid exports and the stored copies of imported files hold
# personal data. Never commit them. Anchored to the repo root: a bare
# "imports/" also hid the admin page apps/web/src/routes/_authed/messaging/imports/.
/imports/
var/email-evidence/
apps/api/var/
